1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,120
One question, three agencies:

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:04,480
which utilities served states with FEMA

3
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:07,980
major-disaster declarations in Q1 2025,

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:11,190
what did the weather do, and did revenue hold up?

5
00:00:11,383 --> 00:00:14,943
Crosswalk's answer: 12 utilities in 7 declared states.

6
00:00:15,523 --> 00:00:19,223
Revenue rose for 9, fell for 2, and 1 is not comparable.

7
00:00:19,843 --> 00:00:22,493
Degree days rose at the stations of all 12.

8
00:00:23,333 --> 00:00:25,063
A solo entry from Singapore.

9
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:28,300
On one PC, the analyst asks it cold:

10
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:31,150
the agent starts with no remembered keys.

11
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:33,300
It searches a fixed catalogue,

12
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:35,620
then probes each cached Zetaris view:

13
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:38,870
its columns, five rows, and distinct counts.

14
00:00:39,284 --> 00:00:40,904
Nemotron, running locally,

15
00:00:41,284 --> 00:00:44,304
proposes join keys from a menu of the probed columns.

16
00:00:44,904 --> 00:00:47,564
A name-matching baseline also proposes keys.

17
00:00:48,184 --> 00:00:50,254
Nothing is used until it is measured.

18
00:00:50,850 --> 00:00:53,310
Each proposal is measured in Lightning SQL.

19
00:00:54,070 --> 00:00:56,890
The SEC company number, padded to ten digits,

20
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:02,480
matches 97.7% of rows: verified, with IDACORP the orphan.

21
00:01:03,034 --> 00:01:05,414
FEMA states against the states the utilities serve:

22
00:01:05,834 --> 00:01:08,054
87.5%, partial.

23
00:01:08,734 --> 00:01:10,024
Alaska is the orphan.

24
00:01:11,834 --> 00:01:15,004
The control, without the padding, matches none: rejected.

25
00:01:19,966 --> 00:01:22,626
The join map keeps every key: both rates,

26
00:01:22,806 --> 00:01:25,656
the verdict in plain words, and the orphans by name.

27
00:01:26,300 --> 00:01:29,240
MGE Energy is the one invalid row in the

28
00:01:29,260 --> 00:01:31,020
governed layer's data-quality check:

29
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:35,750
its SIC code, 4900, is missing from the reference.

30
00:01:36,467 --> 00:01:38,347
Every number in the answer opens the

31
00:01:38,367 --> 00:01:40,307
Lightning SQL that produced it,

32
00:01:40,447 --> 00:01:43,397
with its rows, its time and its cache state.

33
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:47,180
The same Zetaris instance: the registered sources,

34
00:01:47,540 --> 00:01:49,480
the crosswalk semantic layer with its keys,

35
00:01:49,720 --> 00:01:51,270
and its data-quality rules.

36
00:01:56,300 --> 00:02:00,590
Now the same question for Q1 2023, asked warm.

37
00:02:06,534 --> 00:02:10,014
The agent registers what that quarter lacks, live in Zetaris,

38
00:02:10,034 --> 00:02:11,354
under a signed contract:

39
00:02:12,014 --> 00:02:15,364
FEMA's declarations for the quarter, in 1.6 seconds.

40
00:02:18,067 --> 00:02:21,237
Then the year-earlier revenue frames, one tag at a time.

41
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:29,580
Eight measure steps are skipped:

42
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:31,860
those keys were verified by an earlier

43
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:33,810
run and recalled from memory.

44
00:02:34,633 --> 00:02:38,213
On the same probes, the baseline verified 25 of 30 proposals,

45
00:02:38,533 --> 00:02:40,293
and the model verified 3 of 11.

46
00:02:40,813 --> 00:02:41,733
The baseline wins.

47
00:02:42,327 --> 00:02:44,507
Run by hand from statements prepared in advance,

48
00:02:44,927 --> 00:02:48,887
the five keys took 27 statements, 2 lookups and 24 decisions.

49
00:02:49,773 --> 00:02:51,443
The agent asks for none.

50
00:02:51,834 --> 00:02:53,694
Zetaris Lightning holds the sources,

51
00:02:54,114 --> 00:02:55,794
the cached views and the governed layer.

52
00:02:56,394 --> 00:02:58,254
Meterless gives the memory and the loop.

53
00:02:58,814 --> 00:03:01,924
Nemotron 3 Nano runs in Ollama on this PC.

54
00:03:02,633 --> 00:03:06,193
Crosswalk's answer: 12 utilities in 7 declared states.

55
00:03:06,730 --> 00:03:08,950
Every join key behind it was measured first.
